            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Auto insurance is the first major insurance policy most adults purchase, and it is also the type most frequently misunderstood. Many drivers believe their policy \"covers everything\" without recognizing that auto insurance is actually a bundle of five distinct coverages, each addressing a different category of loss. Understanding what each coverage does is essential for buying the right protection at the right price."
